# FairLens Backend

Read `project_state.md` first if you are resuming work in this repository.

This repository contains the Python-only backend for the FairLens ATS Pipeline. It exposes a FastAPI service for secure upload initialization, audit job submission, fairness reporting, artifact retrieval, and hosted-model scoring. The implementation is local-first for development and testing, with explicit adapter boundaries for Google Cloud Storage, Vertex AI, and Pub/Sub.

The README is completed after the implementation sections are in place. See `project_state.md` for the in-progress architecture and implementation status.

